#===============================================================================
#  PURPOSE:
#    Engineering reference for the autonomous kernel‑level health monitoring
#    engine responsible for:
#      • system load analysis
#      • engine heartbeat tracking
#      • anomaly detection
#      • stability scoring
#
#===============================================================================
#  MODULE SUMMARY:
#
#    - [System Metrics](ca://s?q=Explain_System_Metrics)
#    - [Engine Heartbeats](ca://s?q=Explain_Engine_Heartbeats)
#    - [Anomaly Drift](ca://s?q=Explain_Anomaly_Drift)
#    - [Health Snapshots](ca://s?q=Explain_Health_Snapshot)
#    - [Periodic Monitoring](ca://s?q=Explain_Periodic_Monitoring)
#
#===============================================================================
#  FUNCTION OVERVIEW:
#
#    - register_engine(name)
#         Registers an engine for heartbeat tracking.
#
#    - heartbeat(name)
#         Updates engine heartbeat timestamp.
#
#    - snapshot()
#         Produces full system + engine health packet.
#
#    - monitor(interval)
#         Runs continuous async monitoring loop.
#
#    - get_history()
#         Returns historical health snapshots.
#
#===============================================================================
#  HEALTH SCORE MODEL:
#
#    overall_score =
#        CPU load factor        (25%)
#        Memory pressure        (25%)
#        Disk usage             (20%)
#        Engine heartbeat avg   (30%)
#        + stochastic drift
#
